### ---------- List (spec 9.4) ----------

### Default: page 1, 25 rows, by last name → 200, totalCount 25
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Search by name / e-mail / employee code
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users?search=הרפז
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Filters: handlers of פיתוח
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users?departmentId=2&role=Handler
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Filter: inactive only → Orit
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users?isActive=false
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Sort + page: by employee code descending, 5 per page, page 2
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users?sortBy=employeeCode&sortDir=desc&pageSize=5&page=2
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### pageSize above 100 → 400, errors.pageSize
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users?pageSize=500
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### pageSize 0 → 400
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users?pageSize=0
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### sortBy outside the closed list → 400, errors.sortBy
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users?sortBy=passwordHash
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Not a number → 400 (model binding), errors.pageSize
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users?pageSize=abc
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Employee → 403
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{employee.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### No token → 401
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users

